  "description": "Variable Name (Sampling): Turbot Recruitment (Annual) ID: 33 Region: Bering Sea, East Data Type: Fisheries Units: normalized Lon.:168W Lat.: 60N Start Year: 1965 End Year: 1997\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The Unaami Data Collection is an interdisciplinary, diverse collection of Arctic variables which represent different geographic regions and data types. It includes basic physical meteorological and oceanographic data and \"impact data\" such as fisheries, marine mammals, ozone and plant changes.",
